msgid "Unable to locate character config data. Create new data?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャラクターのコンフィグデータ作成に必要な空き容量が足りません。<num $n1> <switch $n2><case>Byte<case>KB<case>MB<case>GB</switch>以上の空き容量が必要です。<br>空き容量を確保するためのユーティリティを起動しますか？
#. de: Nicht genügend Speicherplatz. Die Erstellung der Daten erfordert <num $n1> <switch $n2><case>Byte<case>KB<case>MB<case>GB</switch> freien Speicher. Festplatten-Utility jetzt öffnen?
#. fr: Il n'y a pas assez de place sur le disque dur pour créer des données de configuration du personnage.<br>Il vous faut <num $n1> <switch $n2><case>o<case>Ko<case>Mo<case>Go</switch> d'espace libre.<br>Ouvrir le gestionnaire du disque dur<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>bytes<case>KB<case>MB<case>GB</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:6101:0:0"
msgid "There is not enough space on your hard drive to create character config data.<br>An additional <num $n1> <switch $n2><case>bytes<case>KB<case>MB<case>GB</switch> of space is required.<br>Open the hard drive utility?"
msgstr ""

