msgctxt "Addon:6128:0:0"
msgid "Thank you for your report. A representative will review it shortly.<br><br>Notification of a reply will be displayed in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Recent Replies & Notices</ui-edge-color></ui-color> located under the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Information</ui-edge-color></ui-color> tab. Depending on the issue, the representative may request further information. All queries and replies can be viewed under the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>History</ui-edge-color></ui-color> tab. "
msgstr ""

